WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.720
Do you know how to play charades?

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.600
Carl, you're sure you've never played?

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.660
OK, Betty, Tim, and Frank.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.000
We're going to play charades.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.220
Frank, you can learn as we go.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.120
And, Carl, you join in at any time.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.820
OK, let me think.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.020
OK, I've got one.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.280
All right.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.000
A movie!

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.080
Right.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.560
A movie.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.520
Six words.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:03.920
We've got a movie.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.720
The title ...

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:06.100
Six words.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.120
Right.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.820
First word ...

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.680
Sounds like.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:16.600
You got that part right.

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:16.940
Yes.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.140
Sounds like ...

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.940
Sounds like what?

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.480
Sounds like no.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.040
Absolutely right, Frank.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.560
Sounds like no.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.460
We've got a movie.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:33.370
Six words.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.550
The first word sounds like no.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.540
Row. Row.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:40.920
Go.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:41.980
Nope.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:44.940
Show.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.120
That's it--show.

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:58.740
Absolutely right, Betty.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.220
Sounds like no -- snow.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.570
OK, a movie. Six words.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.140
The first word is snow.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.720
This is fun.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.820
The fifth word.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.160
Right, fifth word.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.490
Absolutely right.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:20.980
Very good.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:21.830
The fifth word is seven.

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:24.020
OK, we've got a movie.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:26.040
The first word is snow.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.340
Fifth word, seven.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:29.990
I got it!

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:30.940
I got it!

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:41.340
I got it.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.420
Frank, you got it.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.140
I knew it.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:51.920
Why don't you join us?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.280
I don't like charades.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.420
It's for babies.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:56.480
Oh, I like it.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.220
Well, they're babies.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:01.820
You're a sore loser.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:03.240
No arguing.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.460
Save your voices.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.360
Between now and tomorrow

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.200
you're all going to have your tonsils out.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.810
And you won't be able to speak for a while.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.760
So save your voices till then.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.620
Hi, gang. Hi, everybody.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:17.240
Well, what's going on?

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.060
I sure I am glad to see you, Dr. Stewart.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.180
This is a rough group.

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:24.240
so they're angry at me.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.820
Why don't you want to play?

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.820
Because I don't want to be here.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.660
I don't want my tonsils out.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.700
Why not?

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.660
Because my birthday is tomorrow.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.940
My mother promised me a birthday party with a clown.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.280
But you can have one when you go home, Carl.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.400
But my birthday is tomorrow.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.120
I'm sorry, Carl.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.500
Carl, you'll have your party when you go home.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.900
But it won't be on my birthday!
